   "title": "Recomendation",
   "properties": {
    "ue_properties": {
     "widget_ue_connectable": {},
     "version": "7.1",
     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    }
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Adjust MultiGPU virtual vram from 8 to 32 gb, i recomend having 32 gb RAM at least\n\nRecomend Resolutions:\n\n2.0 MP\n\n1:1 exact 1448 x 1448, rounded 1408 x 1408\n\n3:2 exact 1773 x 1182, rounded 1728 x 1152\n\n4:3 exact 1672 x 1254, rounded 1664 x 1216\n\n16:9 exact 1936 x 1089, rounded 1920 x 1088\n\n21:9 exact 2212 x 948, rounded 2176 x 960\n\n----------------------------\n\n1.0 MP \n\nI ended up with familiar numbers I've used with SDXL, which gives me confidence in the calculations.\n\n1:1 exact 1024 x 1024\n\n3:2 exact 1254 x 836, rounded 1216 x 832\n\n4:3 exact 1182 x 887, rounded 1152 x 896\n\n16:9 exact 1365 x 768, rounded 1344 x 768\n\n21:9 exact 1564 x 670, rounded 1536 x 640\n\n----------------------\n\n4.0 MP\n\n1:1 exact 2000 x 2000, rounded 2048 x 2048\n\n3:2 exact 2449 x 1663, rounded 2432 x 1620\n\n4:3 exact 2309 x 1732, rounded 2304 x 1728\n\n16:9 exact 2670 x 1502, rounded 2688 x 1512\n\n21:9 exact 3501 x 1308, rounded 3040 x 1304\n\nset from 20 to 30+ steps to generate image (30+ steps gives a better image result)\n\nAlso u can generate image UP TO 4K resolution (3840x2160)\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "Adjust MultiGPU virtual vram from 8 to 32 gb, i recomend having 32 gb RAM at least\n\nRecomend Resolutions:\n\n2.0 MP\n\n1:1 exact 1448 x 1448, rounded 1408 x 1408\n\n3:2 exact 1773 x 1182, rounded 1728 x 1152\n\n4:3 exact 1672 x 1254, rounded 1664 x 1216\n\n16:9 exact 1936 x 1089, rounded 1920 x 1088\n\n21:9 exact 2212 x 948, rounded 2176 x 960\n\n----------------------------\n\n1.0 MP \n\nI ended up with familiar numbers I've used with SDXL, which gives me confidence in the calculations.\n\n1:1 exact 1024 x 1024\n\n3:2 exact 1254 x 836, rounded 1216 x 832\n\n4:3 exact 1182 x 887, rounded 1152 x 896\n\n16:9 exact 1365 x 768, rounded 1344 x 768\n\n21:9 exact 1564 x 670, rounded 1536 x 640\n\n----------------------\n\n4.0 MP\n\n1:1 exact 2000 x 2000, rounded 2048 x 2048\n\n3:2 exact 2449 x 1663, rounded 2432 x 1620\n\n4:3 exact 2309 x 1732, rounded 2304 x 1728\n\n16:9 exact 2670 x 1502, rounded 2688 x 1512\n\n21:9 exact 3501 x 1308, rounded 3040 x 1304\n\nset from 20 to 30+ steps to generate image (30+ steps gives a better image result)\n\nAlso u can generate image UP TO 4K resolution (3840x2160)\n"
   },
